#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Overview of noise management techniques {#overview-of-noise-management-"
"techniques}"
msgstr ""
"Gambaran keseluruhan teknik pengurusan hingar {#overview-of-noise-"
"management-techniques}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When executing quantum workloads, there are multiple ways to reduce the "
"impact of noise. The open-source Qiskit addons provide error mitigation and "
"suppression techniques that integrate directly into your development "
"workflow, while Qiskit Runtime applies advanced error mitigation strategies "
"automatically when jobs are submitted for execution. This page indexes all "
"available tools and features across both options to help you choose the "
"right approach to manage noise when building quantum workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semasa melaksanakan beban kerja kuantum, terdapat beberapa cara untuk "
"mengurangkan impak hingar. Tambahan Qiskit sumber terbuka menyediakan teknik"
" pengurangan ralat dan penindasan ralat yang terintegrasi langsung ke dalam "
"aliran kerja pembangunan anda, manakala Qiskit Runtime menggunakan strategi "
"pengurangan ralat lanjutan secara automatik apabila kerja dihantar untuk "
"pelaksanaan. Halaman ini mengindeks semua alatan dan ciri yang tersedia "
"merentasi kedua-dua pilihan untuk membantu anda memilih pendekatan yang "
"tepat dalam menguruskan hingar semasa membina beban kerja kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"General noise management techniques {#general-noise-management-techniques}"
msgstr "Teknik pengurusan hingar umum {#general-noise-management-techniques}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Directed execution model\"\n"
"      description=\"Fine-tune error mitigation and other techniques by capturing design intents on the client side, and shifting the costly generation of circuit variants to the server side.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/directed-execution-model\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Directed execution model\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Model pelaksanaan berarah\"\n"
"      description=\"Perhalusi pengurangan ralat dan teknik lain dengan menangkap niat reka bentuk di sisi klien, dan mengalihkan penjanaan variasi Circuit yang mahal ke sisi pelayan.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/directed-execution-model\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Directed execution model\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Dynamical decoupling\"\n"
"      description=\"Inserts pulse sequences on idling qubits to suppress coherence errors caused by unwanted interactions between qubits during circuit execution.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#dynamical-decoupling\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Dynamical decoupling\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Learn more\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Dynamical decoupling\"\n"
"      description=\"Menyisipkan urutan nadi pada Qubit yang melahu untuk menindas ralat koheren yang disebabkan oleh interaksi tidak diingini antara Qubit semasa pelaksanaan Circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#dynamical-decoupling\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Dynamical decoupling\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Ketahui lebih lanjut\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Pauli twirling\"\n"
"      description=\"Noise-tailoring technique that transforms any noise channel into a Pauli channel that has a more specific structure; often combined with other error mitigation techniques that work well with Pauli noise.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Pauli twirling\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Learn more\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Pauli twirling\"\n"
"      description=\"Teknik penyesuaian hingar yang mengubah mana-mana saluran hingar kepada saluran Pauli yang mempunyai struktur lebih khusus; sering digabungkan dengan teknik pengurangan ralat lain yang berfungsi baik dengan hingar Pauli.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Pauli twirling\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Ketahui lebih lanjut\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon\"\n"
"      description=\"Users can compile the initial portion of a circuit into a nearly equivalent approximation of that circuit, but with fewer layers.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Approximate quantum compilation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Tambahan Qiskit AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Pengguna boleh menyusun bahagian awal Circuit kepada anggaran hampir setara Circuit tersebut, tetapi dengan lapisan yang lebih sedikit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Approximate quantum compilation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error mitigation for expectation value estimation {#error-mitigation-for-"
"expectation-value-estimation}"
msgstr ""
"Pengurangan ralat untuk anggaran nilai jangkaan {#error-mitigation-for-"
"expectation-value-estimation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Twirled readout error extinction (TREX)\"\n"
"      description=\"Error mitigation tool within Qiskit Runtime which mitigate the effects of measurement errors by randomly substituting them with a twirled measurement sequence.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: TREX\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Learn more\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE)\"\n"
"      description=\"Error mitigation technique that computes the expectation value at different noise levels, and then estimates the ideal result by extrapolating the noisy expectation value results to the zero-noise limit.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: ZNE\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Learn more\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Probabilistic error amplification (PEA)\"\n"
"      description=\"ZNE technique that involves running preliminary experiments to learn a twirled noise model of the circuit, then uses this model to perform a more accurate error amplification.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PEA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Learn more\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Probabilistic error cancellation (PEC)\"\n"
"      description=\"Returns an unbiased estimate of the expectation value, at the expense of greater overhead than other techniques such as ZNE. It extrapolates output of the ideal circuit by executing different noisy circuit instances.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PEC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Learn more\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Twirled readout error extinction (TREX)\"\n"
"      description=\"Alat pengurangan ralat dalam Qiskit Runtime yang mengurangkan kesan ralat ukuran dengan menggantikannya secara rawak dengan urutan ukuran yang digulung.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: TREX\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Ketahui lebih lanjut\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE)\"\n"
"      description=\"Teknik pengurangan ralat yang mengira nilai jangkaan pada tahap hingar berbeza, kemudian menganggar keputusan ideal dengan mengekstrapolasi keputusan nilai jangkaan berhingar ke had sifar-hingar.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: ZNE\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Ketahui lebih lanjut\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Probabilistic error amplification (PEA)\"\n"
"      description=\"Teknik ZNE yang melibatkan menjalankan eksperimen awal untuk mempelajari model hingar yang digulung bagi Circuit, kemudian menggunakan model ini untuk melakukan amplifikasi ralat yang lebih tepat.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PEA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Ketahui lebih lanjut\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Probabilistic error cancellation (PEC)\"\n"
"      description=\"Mengembalikan anggaran tidak berat sebelah bagi nilai jangkaan, dengan kos overhed yang lebih besar berbanding teknik lain seperti ZNE. Ia mengekstrapolasi output Circuit ideal dengan melaksanakan instans Circuit berhingar yang berbeza.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#probabilistic-error-cancellation-pec\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PEC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Ketahui lebih lanjut\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"PEC with shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      description=\"A modified PEC technique that uses Pauli propagation to reduce the number of error terms accounted for in a noise model according to the specifics of the target observable.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation (OBP)\"\n"
"      description=\"Uses a method based on Clifford perturbation theory to reduce circuit depth by trimming operations from its end at the cost of more operator measurements.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption (PNA)\"\n"
"      description=\"Technique for mitigating errors in observable expectation values by 'absorbing' the inverses of learned noise channels into an observable using Pauli propagation.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"PEC dengan kon cahaya berlorek\"\n"
"      description=\"Teknik PEC yang diubah suai yang menggunakan perambatan Pauli untuk mengurangkan bilangan sebutan ralat yang diambil kira dalam model hingar mengikut spesifik boleh pantau sasaran.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation (OBP)\"\n"
"      description=\"Menggunakan kaedah berdasarkan teori gangguan Clifford untuk mengurangkan kedalaman Circuit dengan memangkas operasi dari penghujungnya dengan kos lebih banyak ukuran operator.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption (PNA)\"\n"
"      description=\"Teknik untuk mengurangkan ralat dalam nilai jangkaan boleh pantau dengan 'menyerap' songsangan saluran hingar yang dipelajari ke dalam boleh pantau menggunakan perambatan Pauli.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error mitigation for sampling results {#error-mitigation-for-sampling-"
"results}"
msgstr ""
"Pengurangan ralat untuk keputusan pensampelan {#error-mitigation-for-"
"sampling-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)\"\n"
"      description=\"Implements a technique for finding eigenvalues and eigenvectors of quantum operators, such as a quantum system Hamiltonian, using quantum and distributed classical computing together.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)\"\n"
"      description=\"Melaksanakan teknik untuk mencari nilai eigen dan vektor eigen operator kuantum, seperti Hamiltonian sistem kuantum, menggunakan pengkomputeran kuantum dan klasikal teragih bersama-sama.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"An HPC-ready implementation of the SQD addon. It is written in modern C++17 standards and is designed to create a single compiled binary for use with MPI.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD untuk HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"Implementasi tambahan SQD yang sedia HPC. Ia ditulis dalam piawaian C++17 moden dan direka untuk mencipta binari terkompil tunggal untuk digunakan dengan MPI.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation\"\n"
"      description=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation (M3) is a package for scalable quantum measurement error mitigation that can be computed in parallel.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation\"\n"
"      description=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation (M3) adalah pakej untuk pengurangan ralat ukuran kuantum berskala yang boleh dikira secara selari.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Layari dokumentasi\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
